          "description": "Consumer-supplied variable conductivity of shape [x, y], k = 1 + 0.5 cos(2 pi x_gi) at cell centers x_gi = (gi - 1/2)/4, spelled inline from literals and the edge-bound NX=4. Bound by the rule's match as the coefficient k (the left factor of k*D(u,wrt)); read by the expanded stencil at the faces. The aggregate loops over gi/gj, distinct from the stencil's interior indices i/j, per the keyed-factor convention (see the rule description)."
        },
